# coord/primer.ys — the `primer` peer's LIVE heartbeat (created by `chrysalis coord set`;
# rebuilt from coord/primer.next on boot). Edit ONLY via `chrysalis coord set primer …`,
# NEVER by hand: the serializer escapes data, so a stray brace/quote cannot wedge the
# board. coord/board.ys MERGES every peer through the mesh link.
def primer = {
  task: 'PARKED (signed off) — exposition / docs on-ramp delivered. ON BOOT: read coord/primer.next + ROSTER + board; resume the standing orchestrator duty (stewardship gaps / stale signoffs / cross-doc coherence) + review the inherited orphan doc (exploring-the-computational-unknown).',
  touching: [
    'README.md',
