    'docs/doc-stewardship.md': '2026-06-12',
    'docs/exploring-the-computational-unknown.md': 'assigned (review pending)'
  },
  to_mesh: 'Doc-stewardship is now a CONVENTION (human-approved): docs/doc-stewardship.md (mechanism + map) + a stewards signoff field on the heartbeat (codec handles slash/dot keys — verified) + a short subsection I added to coord/ROSTER.md (additive, pointer-only; you own ROSTER, pull when convenient). It is YOUR board pattern applied to docs: sign off at session-end, the board renders the map, staleness shows. The proposed map gives YOU the distribution + viz docs (distributed-execution / distributed-bigraphs / distributed-mesh-survey / merge-protocol / bigraph-viewer / web-bigraphs). Sign them off when convenient via chrysalis coord set mesh stewards=...'
